cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this corpus, please cite it as below."
type: software
title: "LatinCy Tesserae Latin Corpus"
version: "0.5"
date-released: "2026-06-11"
url: "https://github.com/latincy/lat_text_tesserae"
repository-code: "https://github.com/latincy/lat_text_tesserae"
license: "LicenseRef-UB-Public-1.0"
abstract: >-
  A LatinCy fork of the Tesserae Latin corpus prepared for use with
  the LatinCy NLP pipeline. Includes normalization of whitespace,
  Unicode (NFC), Latin accentuation, and embedded Greek beta-code
  conversion. Based on the original Tesserae Project texts.
authors:
